# Chroma library, modern Earth: BOLD WAYS, batch 6 (2026-10-18). One bold way (sometimes two) on each of twelve life events,
# and for each first bold way a well link and a badly link with their own bold ways (starting school: the well link only).
# Played only in played lives. Syntax: header of build.py.

# ================================================================ the power and the networks go down

== bold: the power and the networks go down / W
base: check on the old neighbours door by door, with a torch and a list
likelier_if: mark 'helped someone in need' +10; has [organising people] +10; has [first-aid certificate] +5
- W | set up a street rota, so every frail neighbour is checked twice a day | v: benevolence, conformity | act: set up a street rota so every frail neighbour is checked twice a day | chance: 45 | title: neighbourhood volunteer | drops_if_fails: kind:community
works: By the third night a dozen neighbours are on {Ns} rota, and when the lights come back the street asks {N} to stay on as its volunteer.
works: Nobody on the list is missed all week, and from then on {N} is the volunteer the street calls first.
fails: The rota falls apart on the second night, a frail neighbour is missed, and the row that follows ends with {N} leaving the residents' group.
fails: Half the rota stops turning up, {N} takes the blame for it, and gives up the place in the street's club for good.

== bold: the power and the networks go down / R
base: bring out the candles and the guitar, and turn the dark street into a party
likelier_if: has [singing] +10; has [name on the local scene] +5
- R | play the guitar on the steps all night, and get the whole street singing | v: stimulation, hedonism | act: play the guitar on the steps all night and get the whole street singing | chance: 45 | requires: musical instrument; instrument of one's own | title: folk musician | takes_if_fails: instrument of one's own
works: By the third night the whole street knows the words, and when the lights come back {N} is asked to play at every gathering on the street.
works: {N} becomes the street's own musician, playing the old songs at every party and wake from then on.
fails: Someone stumbles into {N} in the dark, the guitar goes down the steps and splits, and there is no money for another.
fails: The guitar is left out on the steps in the rain on the last night, and it is ruined past mending.

== the plan for the next outage
tier: link
of_bold: the power and the networks go down / W
side: well
delay: 1-2
holds: neighbourhood volunteer
stages: juvenile+
age: 15-100
stakes: .6
tone: mixed
life: community, home
horizon: months
roles: friend, neighbours
earth: a year after the long outage, the council asks the street's volunteer to plan for the next one
scene: A year after the long outage, the council writes to the street's volunteers: draw up a plan for the next one. {friend}, who carried the torches with {N} that week, wants to help write it.
scene gone: {friend} has moved away since the dark week. The council's letter about a plan for the next outage comes to {N} alone.
- W | write the plan the council asked for, item by item, and hand it in on time | v: conformity, security | chance: 80
- U | map every house, every sick neighbour and every spare battery on the street | v: self-direction, security | chance: 75
- B | ask the council for a budget, and for your name at the top of the plan | v: power, achievement | act: ask the council for a budget, and for their name at the top of the plan | chance: 70
- R | skip the paperwork, and run a surprise night drill with torches and soup | v: stimulation, benevolence | chance: 65
- G | gather the old hands on the street and write down what they did last time | v: tradition, benevolence | chance: 75
works: The plan goes into the council's drawer and the street's kitchen drawers, and both copies get used.
works: When the next storm comes, the whole street knows whose door to knock on.
fails: The plan is filed and forgotten, and nobody on the street ever reads it.
fails: Half the volunteers drift off, and the list is out of date within a year.

== bold: the plan for the next outage / W
base: write the plan the council asked for, item by item, and hand it in on time
likelier_if: years [neighbourhood volunteer] 1 +5; has [public speaking] +10; has [voice at the town hall] +10
- W | write the plan, then stand for the council to see it carried out | v: universalism, conformity | act: write the plan, then stand for the council to see it carried out | chance: 30 | requires: good name in town | title: local councillor | takes_if_fails: neighbourhood volunteer
works: The street that came through the dark together votes for {N}, and {N} takes a seat on the council with the plan under one arm.
works: {N} wins the seat by a few dozen votes, and the plan becomes the council's own.
fails: {N} loses the vote badly, the campaign leaves sore feelings on the street, and {N} steps down as its volunteer.
fails: The race turns ugly, {N} comes last, and hands the volunteer's list to someone else before the year is out.

