# ================================================================ a serious accident or illness

== bold: a serious accident or illness / B
base: hire a lawyer and sue for every penny you can get
likelier_if: has [friend in power] +10; has [striking a deal] +10
- B | take the firm that caused it to court, your own boss included | v: power, achievement | act: take the firm that caused it to court, their own boss included | chance: 40 | grants: savings | drops_if_fails: kind:career
works: The case settles on the courthouse steps, and the award goes into the bank as savings that last {N} for years.
works: {N} wins in court, and the money sits in the bank, the first real savings {N} has ever had.
fails: The case is lost, {boss} does not forgive being dragged into court, and {N} is let go.
fails: The firm's lawyers win, and {Ns} job does not survive the fight.

